"timestamp_updated": 1627758234, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96695194", "author": {"steamid": "76561198201846394", "personaname": "Captain Pike", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198201846394/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 930, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 631, "last_played": 1666218954, "avatar": "a10d00c1d7e1dbff44a17780eae54e501162fb3f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I cannot stress how much I love this game. I have played all of the series and this one has a well balanced feel of all of the EDF's combined. Giant Bugs, Check. Infinite Ammo, Check! Hilarious side comments from your troopers, Check! If you havent played any of the EDF it is basically a sandbox crafted game with hundreds of weapons and vehicles to choose from. Kiajus, Giant Insects, Aliens etc attack in relentless hordes. A really fun game to play with first time FPS. Simple controls and a simple approach to the game components make it really approachable. I trained my wife on mouse and keyboard with this one. Great for enjoyment and a good laugh.", "timestamp_created": 1627742701, "timestamp_updated": 1627742701, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96521674", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032250664", "personaname": "Axel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Axel_Dark/", "num_games_owned": 1841, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 3000, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1884, "last_played": 1768075234, "avatar": "56e04c0f4e3ff56ecb1d391aa8ec5132971f0ccd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Full of bugs, 10 out of 10", "timestamp_created": 1627484651, "timestamp_updated": 1627484651, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "96519351", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973840927", "personaname": "VideoKojima", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/VideoKojima1/", "num_games_owned": 1867, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 8127, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7583, "last_played": 1721823167, "avatar": "d5ef4362edca6f3589e0db000fbd434fba2c8f1a"}, "language": "english", "review": "There are bugs and frog people that look exactly like humans. Like they can't look any closer to a human. It was like looking into a mirror because of how similar they are. \n\nto humans.\n\nPlay as local Japanese Exterminator who climbs the ranks of his bug defense company to fight bigger bugs and a godzilla. Some times many godzillas. \n\nI bought this at full price and I love it. Your finger will hurt eventually, that's what we call the vidya trigger finger. Also waifus fly. 9/10 It's japanese call of duty.", "timestamp_created": 1627481839, "timestamp_updated": 1627481839, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.555209934711456299", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 7, "count": 1}]}]}